# Core maps and tests

Read [docs/agent-pitfalls.md](../../docs/agent-pitfalls.md) and the matching section of [docs/architecture.md](../../docs/architecture.md) before changing traversal, generation, or planners.

## Rules

- **No Godot types** in `src/Core`.
- Seeds: deterministic — use [`NoiseSeedUtility`](../../src/Core/Maps/Noise/NoiseSeedUtility.cs); do not use `HashCode` for seed derivation.
- [`MapIntegrity`](../../src/Core/Maps/MapIntegrity.cs): respect vertical-link and floor connectivity rules; use `ValidateModification` / `ValidateVerticalLink` for local edits where applicable.

## Tests

- New traversal, planner, or mask behavior → add or extend tests in `tests/SpecialPG.Core.Tests`.
- Run `dotnet test` before claiming done.

Existing regression coverage examples: `TileTransitionPlannerTests`, `TileMainPatchPlannerTests`.
